    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/bb690d8460796568c4d05613e0c3c41a.avif?t=1748967726\" width=800 height=82 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/d968ee9cfcaa027de2a93f47ceaecd29.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/d968ee9cfcaa027de2a93f47ceaecd29.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/d968ee9cfcaa027de2a93f47ceaecd29.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ff7f14a0d26ecab1c1429622e4c3121f.avif?t=1748967726\" width=800 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/2e4c82800d085f143a2274326b90432f.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/2e4c82800d085f143a2274326b90432f.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/2e4c82800d085f143a2274326b90432f.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/f95270360f4c3d36a731274c4e35cd0e.avif?t=1748967726\" width=800 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/0d945ba64d19655f29bc40e93e33f72c.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/0d945ba64d19655f29bc40e93e33f72c.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/0d945ba64d19655f29bc40e93e33f72c.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creator:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My girlfriend and I dropped out of university to start developing games. She handles the designs, while I take care of the programming.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To support us, please add to your Wishlist now :))</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive in a World Without Trust?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>1-8 player Multiplayer co-op party</strong> game with <strong>Active Ragdoll</strong> mechanics and physics-based interactions! In a post-apocalyptic world devastated by a zombie outbreak, you\u2019ll soon realize that your biggest enemy isn\u2019t just the zombies:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doubt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player starts as a human. Your mission is simple: <strong>Survive</strong>, gather supplies, and establish a safe zone with your team. But as time passes, the <strong>infection spreads silently</strong>, and even your closest friend might be hiding a secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When infected, a player <strong>loses control of their actions</strong> and starts attacking teammates unwillingly. You never know <strong>when, where, or who</strong> will be infected next. The scariest part? <strong>The longer an infected player hides their condition, the stronger a zombie they become!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Can You Trust?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay human, <strong>cooperate with your team</strong>, recruit NPCs to your group, or loot them for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If infected, <strong>conceal your identity</strong>, evolve into a stronger zombie, and sabotage your team from within.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arm Yourself, Use Your Wits, and Fight to Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From melee weapons to ranged firearms, <strong>a variety of combat options await you.</strong> Manage your resources wisely, take down enemies, and prove yourself as the <strong>strongest survivor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match lasts <strong>40-45 minutes</strong>, but your choices will determine its outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you trust your best friend? What if they\u2019ve been infected and are keeping it a secret? What will you do?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/bb690d8460796568c4d05613e0c3c41a.avif?t=1748967726\" width=800 height=82 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/d968ee9cfcaa027de2a93f47ceaecd29.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/d968ee9cfcaa027de2a93f47ceaecd29.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/d968ee9cfcaa027de2a93f47ceaecd29.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ff7f14a0d26ecab1c1429622e4c3121f.avif?t=1748967726\" width=800 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/2e4c82800d085f143a2274326b90432f.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/2e4c82800d085f143a2274326b90432f.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/2e4c82800d085f143a2274326b90432f.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/f95270360f4c3d36a731274c4e35cd0e.avif?t=1748967726\" width=800 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/0d945ba64d19655f29bc40e93e33f72c.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/0d945ba64d19655f29bc40e93e33f72c.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/0d945ba64d19655f29bc40e93e33f72c.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creator:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My girlfriend and I dropped out of university to start developing games. She handles the designs, while I take care of the programming.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To support us, please add to your Wishlist now :))</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.poster.avif?t=1748967726\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.webm?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425330/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.mp4?t=1748967726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive in a World Without Trust?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>1-8 player Multiplayer co-op party</strong> game with <strong>Active Ragdoll</strong> mechanics and physics-based interactions! In a post-apocalyptic world devastated by a zombie outbreak, you\u2019ll soon realize that your biggest enemy isn\u2019t just the zombies:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doubt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player starts as a human. Your mission is simple: <strong>Survive</strong>, gather supplies, and establish a safe zone with your team. But as time passes, the <strong>infection spreads silently</strong>, and even your closest friend might be hiding a secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When infected, a player <strong>loses control of their actions</strong> and starts attacking teammates unwillingly. You never know <strong>when, where, or who</strong> will be infected next. The scariest part? <strong>The longer an infected player hides their condition, the stronger a zombie they become!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Can You Trust?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay human, <strong>cooperate with your team</strong>, recruit NPCs to your group, or loot them for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If infected, <strong>conceal your identity</strong>, evolve into a stronger zombie, and sabotage your team from within.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arm Yourself, Use Your Wits, and Fight to Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From melee weapons to ranged firearms, <strong>a variety of combat options await you.</strong> Manage your resources wisely, take down enemies, and prove yourself as the <strong>strongest survivor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match lasts <strong>40-45 minutes</strong>, but your choices will determine its outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you trust your best friend? What if they\u2019ve been infected and are keeping it a secret? What will you do?</p>",
    "short_description": "You have to be a team to survive. But!!! Can you trust your best friend? What if they're infected and hiding it? What will you do with them? Multiplayer co-op party game for 1-8 players. Challenges you to survive by betraying your team.",
